# Cursor & AI Agent Rules for uniconn

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `llms.txt` first for module structure and public API signatures.
- Python 3.11+ async-first codebase managed via `uv`.
- Line length limit: 100 characters (`ruff check src/`).
- Type checking: `pyright` in standard mode (`0 errors` required across `src/uniconn`).
- Maintain strict parity between `Connection` (`src/uniconn/_connection.py`) and `SyncConnection` (`src/uniconn/_sync.py`).
- All public symbols must be exported in `src/uniconn/__init__.py` (`__all__`).
- Run `uv run pytest -m "not integration"`, `uv run ruff check src/`, and `uv run pyright` after code changes.
